<title>NETHERLANDS: SLIGRO PRELIMINARY 1996 NET UP 20.9 PCT.</title>
<headline>SLIGRO PRELIMINARY 1996 NET UP 20.9 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>VEGHEL, Netherlands 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary figures</p>
<p>for year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.03 vs   5.32</p>
<p>    Net profit			    19.7  vs  16.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			     952.8  vs 865.5</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    34.8  vs  30.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			19.7  vs  16.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Groceries and food wholesaler Sligro Beheer NV said</p>
<p>it would publish its full 1996 results, dividend proposal and</p>
<p>expectations for 1997 on February 3.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
